messages.en:
{07 00 00}If you live alone like me, 
you must understand why
my place is so messy.
{07 16 00}When there's no one around
to holler at you, it's easy
to let your place go!{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 00 00}Nobody should live alone
forever, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 01 00}
{07 15 00}That goes for both of us{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Kui sa elad üksi nagu mina, 
pead sa mõistma, miks
mu kodu on nii segamini.
{07 16 00}Kui pole kedagi, kes sulle
karjuks, on lihtne lasta
kodul käest minna!{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 00 00}Keegi ei peaks igavesti
üksi elama, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 01 00}
{07 15 00}See käib meie mõlema{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}
